  m_text: 'Auto Spin \nTap to start the auto spin or open the autospin settings panel.
    \n AutoSpin Settings:\n\nTotal Spins:\nYou can set the number of rounds to play
    automatically and stop the game after reaching the limit.\n \nSingle win ratio
    exceeds:\nThe game will be stopped when the single round winnings are greater
    than the specified multiples.\n\nStop if balance<:\nStop the game when your balance
    is less than the set value.\n\nStop if balance>:

    Stop the game when your
    balance is greater than the set value.\n\nStop if "Bonus Game" is activated\nStop
    the game when entering a Bonus Gamee (only displayed if there are Bonus Game
    rules)\n\nStop if "Free Game" is activated:\nStop the game when entering a free
    game (only displayed if there are free game rules)\n\nStart:\nTap "Start" button
    to activate the autoplay feature.\nCancel:\nTap "Cancel" button to return to
    game screen.'
