  m_text: '1. Super Ace is a video slot with 5\n    reels, 4 rows and 1024 ways.\n2.
    All wins pay with left most reel to right \n    on adjacent reels.\n3. During
    the game, all winning symbol(s)\n    will "flip" again. After the flip" will 
    \n    appear new symbol(s) replaced the\n    previous winning symbol(s) and re-\n   
    evalaute for more wins. If there is no \n    winning symbols after the re-evaluated,
    \n    the current game winning amount will \n    be awarded to  player.

'
